    filterAttrs :: (String -> a -> Bool) -> { [String] :: a } -> { [String] :: a }

##### Examples

**Example 16. `lib.attrsets.filterAttrs` usage example**

    filterAttrs (n: v: n == "foo") { foo = 1; bar = 2; }
    => { foo = 1; }

