**Example 155. `lib.fixedPoints.toExtension` usage example**

    fix (final: { a = 0; c = final.a; })
    => { a = 0; c = 0; };

    fix (extends (toExtension { a = 1; b = 2; }) (final: { a = 0; c = final.a; }))
    => { a = 1; b = 2; c = 1; };

