- `subpath`: The [normalised subpath string](/manual/nixpkgs/unstable/#function-library-lib.path.subpath.normalise "lib.path.subpath.normalise") that when [appended](/manual/nixpkgs/unstable/#function-library-lib.path.append "lib.path.append") to `root` returns the original path.

