- [Appending](/manual/nixpkgs/unstable/#function-library-lib.path.append "lib.path.append") the `root` and `subpath` gives the original path:

    p ==
      append
        (splitRoot p).root
        (splitRoot p).subpath

- Trying to get the parent directory of `root` using [`dirOf`](https://nixos.org/manual/nix/stable/language/builtins.html#builtins-dirOf) returns `root` itself:

