    subpath.components :: String -> [String]

##### Examples

**Example 238. `subpath.components` usage example**

    subpath.components "."
    => [ ]

    subpath.components "./foo//bar/./baz/"
    => [ "foo" "bar" "baz" ]

    subpath.components "/foo"
